WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A bad release reaches the cluster. The smoke test catches it and the pipeline rolls back on its own.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Architecture: System view.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Architecture: Deployment, smoke test and rollback sequence.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Revision 1 deploys orders-api 1.0.0. All four smoke checks pass.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Revision 2 deploys 1.1.0 with a simulated defect. Probes stay green but the orders API returns HTTP 500, so the smoke test fails and the release is rolled back to revision 1.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The release history shows the rollback as revision 3, and /version confirms 1.0.0 is serving again.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Verified result. Source, tests and setup steps are linked below.
